  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A simple homebrew released in 2009 as a Halloween gift for the old NintendoAge forums. Your bird automatically flies left-to-right across the screen, looping back to the left once it reaches the edge. Fire apples by pressing the A button, timing the trajectory to hit the targets along the bottom. Each target is worth 1 point, and the screen is refreshed once all targets are eliminated, with all targets remaining in the same place with each regeneration. Your score resets after a missed shot, so a prudent player will aim carefully!"
    }
  ],
